NAME
    gcloud alpha workload-identity service-agents - manage Service Agents for
        Workload Identity

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha workload-identity service-agents COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Service Agents for Workload Identity.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     generate
        (ALPHA) Generate service agents for a service producer.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud workload-identity service-agents

        $ gcloud beta workload-identity service-agents

